    short: "Not the file list",
    lede: "Argo CD applies wave -2, waits until those objects are healthy, then -1, then 0, then 1. The order of files inside kustomization.yaml does not matter.",
    why: "A Deployment that starts before its Secret exists sits in CreateContainerConfigError. A wave makes Argo wait. The init container makes the kubelet wait, which is the stricter guarantee.",
